  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NeedTheCustomers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: "player asks why jessi seems so attached to these customers after
    expressing such clear distaste for them.\n\njessi reluctantly admits that she
    uses her customers as socialization practice to see what works and what doesn't.
    it's the entire reason she even bothered to open this place. \n\nplayer, already
    locked in on this line of questioning, continues to ask why jessi even needs
    this. socialization? why does she need practice with these people when social
    interaction is just a natural part of human life?\n\njessi pauses, too ashamed
    to admit more. player is not waiting around for her to get comfortable, and tells
    her to be out with it.\n\njessi sighs and confesses that shes never had a social
    life before, or at least, her chance at one was robbed from her. player was expecting
    jessi to be bad at socialization, but wonders what being \"robbed from the chance\"
    of it entails; she's curious, but not with good intentions.\n\njessi begs player
    to just drop it, as she's already said enough. player is determined to push this
    boundary, and gets to decide in what way she wants to do it."
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You say you need the customers? For what reason?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Seems to be like you'd prefer to be without them.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, yeah, but...
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Force it out of her
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Be subtle about it
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49ac67e3b50c7e849a8543b56b43b15c, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7c0c35f315b94d428844f9d90f09321, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
